Cubin SASS Preview was extracted from the nv_isa project.
The extension's existing package manifest declared the MIT license; this
standalone distribution retains that license.

The bundled sm_90 tables are research data snapshots from nv_isa, not an
official NVIDIA ISA specification. Form-grammar provenance records the name
and SHA-256 of DefaultInsAsmRepos.sm_90.txt; that source repository file and
CuAssembler implementation are not included or required at runtime.

NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit tools and driver libraries are not distributed here.
They remain subject to their respective licenses and must be installed
separately. NVIDIA and CUDA are trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation; this is
an independent project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.
